      ⍝ regression (Blake McBride, Bugs12.md #2, 2026-08-06): same
      ⍝ uninitialized-Cell bug as Each_monadic.tc, dyadic form -- an
      ⍝ empty nested left AND right argument, whose (disclosed)
      ⍝ prototype items have more than one element.
      ⍝
